# Rat Out: -1/-1 on Grizzly Bears (2/2) leaves a 1/1 until end of turn only (it is 2/2 again on its own turn, where it
# hits for 2), and the Rat token "can't block": Bot1 may not block the attacking Bears with it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Rat Out
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Rat Out.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token.Power = 1
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Grizzly Bears > Bot1)
! Bot1.Block(Rat Token > Grizzly Bears)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Swamp; Rat Token
